  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Curl the headers on any /fcr:versions uri and you'll notice that there are no link headers as I would expect.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Link: <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">;rel=\"type\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Link: <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">;rel=\"type\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To reproduce:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1. Create a resource and then add a version to that resource.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. curl -v     -X HEAD -i ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/your-resource/fcr:versions"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/your-resource/fcr:versions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. verify there are no links returned.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
